Install versioned units from the repo:

  cd /path/to/repo
  ./scripts/install/systemd-user-units.sh

Enable services:

  systemctl --user enable --now qwen-tts.service qwen-tts-clone.service qwen-asr.service deepseek-ocr.service glm-ocr.service ocr-gateway.service

Verify:

  systemctl --user status qwen-tts.service
  systemctl --user status qwen-tts-clone.service
  systemctl --user status qwen-asr.service
  systemctl --user status deepseek-ocr.service
  systemctl --user status glm-ocr.service
  systemctl --user status ocr-gateway.service
  curl http://localhost:8002/health
  curl http://localhost:8004/health
  curl http://localhost:8003/health
  curl http://localhost:8010/health
  curl http://localhost:8011/health
  curl http://localhost:8012/health

Live logs:

  journalctl --user -u qwen-tts.service -f
  journalctl --user -u qwen-tts-clone.service -f
  journalctl --user -u qwen-asr.service -f
  journalctl --user -u deepseek-ocr.service -f
  journalctl --user -u glm-ocr.service -f
  journalctl --user -u ocr-gateway.service -f

Notes:

  - qwen-tts.service uses the proxy to qwen-tts-clone.service when `speaker=MyVoice`.
  - The TTS units force `QWEN_VOICE_RELOAD=false`.
  - Source files live in `systemd/user/`.
